category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Small testing framework for C (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "µnit is a small but full-featured unit testing framework for C. It has no
dependencies (beyond libc), is permissively licensed (MIT), and is easy to
include into any project."
